  "description": "This model/animation was my FIRST EVER 3D model. I didn't even know what a polygon was when I started making this! \n\nThe bump mapped textures have been affected by upload sadly, though I'm chuffed the animation works.\n\nThis was purely a learning project. But it laid the foundation for pretty much everything I would go on to learn.\n\n*About the Gun*\n\nIt is loosely based upon the mid 19thC U.S pattern *Armstrong* Field Gun. 70ib calibre and with a firing range greater than any other piece of artillery in history until then, it was a force to be reckoned with on any battlefield!\n\n**FREE DOWNLOAD!**",
